sequenceDiagram
  actor Rider
  actor Driver
  participant RatingService
  participant RatingRepository
  participant DriverRepository
  participant RiderRepository

  alt Rider rates Driver
    Rider->>RatingService: rateDriver(ride, rating)
    RatingService->>RatingRepository: findByRide
    RatingService->>RatingRepository: save(driverRating)
    RatingService->>DriverRepository: recompute avg + save
  else Driver rates Rider
    Driver->>RatingService: rateRider(ride, rating)
    RatingService->>RatingRepository: findByRide
    RatingService->>RatingRepository: save(riderRating)
    RatingService->>RiderRepository: recompute avg + save
  end
